  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We cannot use `VRC_SpatialAudioSource` inside Udon programs defeating audio systems with an audio source buffer as they cannot adjust the spatial characteristics based on the sound.\nWithout access to this component, we cannot:\n- Disable spatialisation on audio tracks that use `VRC_SpatialAudioSource`,\n- Change `gain` or `far`,\n- Nor change any other advanced settings,\nTherefore I request `VRC_SpatialAudioSource` to be fully exposed to Udon.\nThanks for your time :)",
